    "detailed_description": "<h1>THE FULL VERSION</h1><p>The full version will include more characters, relics, and game modes!<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;Shumo&quot; is a turn-based game with roguelike and deck-building. You can play the prologue content for free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Differences between prologue and full version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Characters: The prologue contains 1 character, and full version contains 3.<br></li><li>Cards: The prologue contains 60 cards, and full version contains 150+ cards.<br></li><li>Relics: The prologue contains 60 relics, and full version contains 100+ relics.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2>Classic Battles: Commence with cards. Acquire relics to build your deck, empowering you to take on formidable foes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/b1b39c2ed5b217fb98840ba65bd15c0f.poster.avif?t=1738938934\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/b1b39c2ed5b217fb98840ba65bd15c0f.webm?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/b1b39c2ed5b217fb98840ba65bd15c0f.mp4?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Roguelike Levels: Chart your course and make decisions that influence the outcome. Each distinct choice leads to a different ending.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/48d06390399d0a5c5a0b249620a69146.poster.avif?t=1738938934\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/48d06390399d0a5c5a0b249620a69146.webm?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/48d06390399d0a5c5a0b249620a69146.mp4?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unique Relics: Every relic possesses distinct characteristics and can be combined to unleash powerful magical combos.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/5e917d772c7e8b72eafd35095ec529ef.poster.avif?t=1738938934\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/5e917d772c7e8b72eafd35095ec529ef.webm?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023440/extras/5e917d772c7e8b72eafd35095ec529ef.mp4?t=1738938934\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
